# kedro-viz session store / run stats — regenerable output of `kedro viz` /
# `kedro run`, never committed. (Also covered by the repo-root .gitignore; kept
# here so this prototype stays self-contained.)
.viz/

# Static-SPA export from `kedro viz build` — regenerated by capture-kedro-viz-proto
# (~11 MB, 230 files). The committed docs/kedro-viz-dag.png is the captured artifact;
# the build/ dir itself is never committed. Deeper-.gitignore rule wins over the
# repo-root `!src/**/packages/*/**` re-include negation.
build/
